@startuml AppleNotesNoteLifecycle
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #4A148C
}

[*] --> Created : FR-002: Create Note

Created --> Editing : FR-004: Open & Edit
Editing --> Saved : Auto-save (3 sec idle)
Saved --> Editing : Continue editing
Saved --> Pinned : FR-008: Pin Note
Pinned --> Saved : Unpin Note
Saved --> Deleted : FR-005: Delete (soft)
Deleted --> Restored : FR-005: Restore from Trash
Restored --> Saved : Note back in folder

Deleted --> Purged : FR-005: Permanent Delete
Purged --> [*]

Saved --> [*] : Note exists in folder
Deleted --> [*] : Note in Trash (recoverable)

note right of Created
    Note created with title + content
    Assigned timestamp, saved to DB
end note

note right of Editing
    FR-004: User opens and edits note
    Changes persisted on 3-sec pause
end note

note right of Pinned
    FR-008: Note marked as favorite
    Appears at top of note list
end note

note right of Deleted
    FR-005: Soft delete (is_deleted=true)
    Note moved to Trash folder
end note

note right of Restored
    FR-005: User restores from Trash
    Note returned to original folder
end note

@enduml
